{"source_doc":"Winkel  Ebook - handover file.pdf","page_num":28,"doc_hash":"56ff89acaeaf0f47","chroma:document":"# 1.26 WINKEL Hose Reel For our products, we use stretch- and pulse-resistant thermoplastically welded hoses as well as other materials. Two-port hoses of this type are uniformly connected along their entire length. Our portfolio contains hoses of different lengths and nominal diameters